msgid "You will be guided through the steps necessary to install this software."
msgstr "Us guiarem pels passos necessaris per instal·lar aquest programari."

#: appinstaller.rs:880
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versió"

#: appinstaller.rs:883
msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "Editor"

